{
  "title": "Juicy Grilled Greek Lamb Burger",
  "description": "A flavorful and herbal Greek dish featuring lamb burgers, served on sesame seed buns with a side of adventure, this recipe is ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly and perfect for a light meal, the lamb is brine-dried to enhance the flavor and texture",
